; 1_fm_example_b — Sonic-style fast bouncy lead (G major)
;
; Quick arpeggiated runs alternating with staccato rests — the
; classic Mega Drive arcade-FM platformer feel.

T220
I1
V13
O5
L16

; A — leaping ascend
G B > D G  > D < B G4
F+ A > C F+  > C < A F+4

; B — running 16ths then resolve
L16
D E F+ G  A B > C D  E D C < B  A G F+ E
L16
D4 G2 R4

; C — answer with grace notes
> D < B G B  > D < B G4
> C < A F+ A  > C < A F+4

; D — descend to tonic
L16
> E D C < B  A G F+ E  D C < B A  G F+ E D
L16
G2 R4 R4

~
